WEBVTT

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:30.290
In fact, he had been convinced at one time

00:07:30.314 --> 00:07:34.125
that to be a good physicist,

00:07:34.149 --> 00:07:37.482
it was very important to have had
that kind of relationship

00:07:37.506 --> 00:07:38.662
with your father.

00:07:38.686 --> 00:07:41.692
I apologize for the sexist
conversation here,

00:07:41.716 --> 00:07:43.576
but this is the way it really happened.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:47.397
He said he had been absolutely
convinced that this was necessary,

00:07:47.421 --> 00:07:51.060
a necessary part of the growing up
of a young physicist.

00:07:51.655 --> 00:07:54.788
Being Dick, he, of course,
wanted to check this.

00:07:54.812 --> 00:07:57.088
He wanted to go out and do an experiment.

00:07:57.112 --> 00:07:58.128
(Laughter)

00:07:58.152 --> 00:07:59.304
Well, he did.

00:07:59.328 --> 00:08:00.986
He went out and did an experiment.